OL,5,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,6,     FThe Academy of St Martin in the
OL,7,     FFields marks Sally Beamish at 70
OL,8,     Fwith her new clarinet concerto:
OL,9,     FMichael Collins plays the UK
OL,10,     Fpremiere of IZAKHI, inspired by
OL,11,     FSouth Africa.
OL,12,G2145 The Essay: Our Island Music
OL,13,     FA musical journey to five British
OL,14,     Fislands.
OL,15,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,16,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,17,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,18,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,19,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,20,     Feverything in between.
